    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "This NCEI Accession includes surface underway data collected from R/V Keifu Maru II in the Pacific Ocean, East China Sea and Sea of Japan, from 2019-01-08 to 2019-10-19. These data include barometric pressure, partial pressure of carbon dioxide - atmosphere, partial pressure of carbon dioxide - water, sea surface salinity and sea surface temperature. The instruments used to collect these data include carbon dioxide (CO2) gas analyzer, shower head chamber equilibrator for autonomous carbon dioxide (CO2) measurement.",
